    note: The evidence directly states that the study evaluates whether cluster-based semantic chunking improves retrieval and answer quality compared to fixed-size and recursive chunking, which matches the claim.

🟡 [partial] RAG quality and hallucinations are automatically evaluated and detected using evaluation models and approaches such as LLM-as-a-Judge, Prometheus, Lynx, the Hughes Hallucination Evaluation Model (HHEM), the Trustworthy Language Model (TLM), and the Retrieval Augmented Generation Assessment (RAGA).
